...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 (브라우저) { class: person }
adk_web: adk web 서버 { class: ext }

openai_path: 2_1_openai_adk_agent/ {
  class: ours
  agent: root_agent (agent.py) { class: ours }
}

anthropic_path: 2_2_anthropic_adk_agent/ {
  class: ours
  agent: root_agent (agent.py) { class: ours }
}

shared: "공통 요소" {
  class: ours

  env: API 키 (.env) { class: file }
  tool: get_fun_fact 도구 { class: ours }
}

openrouter: 모델 게이트웨이 (OpenRouter API) { class: ext }

user -> adk_web: 채팅 메시지 (POST /run)
adk_web -> openai_path: 이름 검증 후 동적 임포트
adk_web -> anthropic_path: 마찬가지
shared -> openai_path: OPENROUTER_API_KEY
shared -> anthropic_path: 마찬가지
shared.tool -> openai_path: tools 파라미터로 연결
shared.tool -> anthropic_path: 마찬가지
openai_path -> openrouter: openrouter/openai/gpt-4o 요청
anthropic_path -> openrouter: openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-4 요청
openrouter -> adk_web: 생성된 응답
adk_web -> user: 응답 표시
